  "text": "Mealie\nLogout\nChange Me\nFavorite Recipes\nCreate\nRecipes\nRecipe Finder\nMeal Planner\nShopping Lists\nTimeline\nCookbooks\nOrganizers\n1\nAnnouncements\nSettings\nEvent Notifiers\nMealie uses the Apprise library to generate notifications. They offer many options for services to use for notifications. Refer to their wiki for a comprehensive guide on how to create the URL for your service. If available, selecting the type of your notification may include extra features.\nApprise\nGotify\nDiscord\nHome Assistant\nMatrix\nPushover\nCreate\nKitchen\nName\nApprise URL (skipped if blank)\nEnable Notifier\n\nWhat events should this notifier subscribe to?\n\nRecipe Events\nCreate\nUpdate\nDelete\nUser Events\nWhen a new user joins your group\nMeal Plan Events\nCreate\nUpdate\nDelete\nShopping List Events\nCreate\nUpdate\nDelete\nCookbook Events\nCreate\nUpdate\nDelete\nTag Events\nCreate\nUpdate\nDelete\nCategory Events\nCreate\nUpdate\nDelete\nLabel Events\nCreate\nUpdate\nDelete",
